n lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=171 valign=top style='width:128.45pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=151 valign=top style='width:4.0cm;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=85 valign=top style='width:63.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=341 valign=top style='width:255.45pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Interpretation :<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<ol style='margin-top:0cm' start=1 type=1>\r\n <li class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\n     font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The scrub Typhus Detect IgM ELISA\r\n     test for exposure to Orientia tsutsugamushi (OT; formerly \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Rickettsia) is an\r\nELISA assay<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 system for the detection of\r\nIgM antibodies in human serum to OT derived recombinant antigen <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 (1-\u00a0 10). This test is to\r\naid in<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0the diagnosis of human\r\nexposure to OT species.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<ol style='margin-top:0cm' start=2 type=1>\r\n <li class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0<\/span><span\r\n     style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Scrub Typhus\r\n     is an infectious disease that is caused by Orientia tsutsugamushi\r\n     (formerly Rickettsia), a tiny parasite about the size of bacteria that\r\n     belongs to the family Rickettsiaceae. A bite from a trombiculid mite, a\r\n     parasite of rodents, will transmit the disease. An ulcer of the skin is\r\n     characteristic of a bite from a trombiculid mite, followed by symptoms\r\n     including<\/span><\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 fever, a spotted rash on\r\nthe torso, and swelling of the lymph glands. Scrub typhus generally\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 occurs after exposure to\r\nareas with secondary (scrub) vegetation, which is where its name is \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 derived from. However, the\r\ndisease can also be prevalent in sandy, mountainous, and tropical \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 areas.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<ol style='margin-top:0cm' start=3 type=1>\r\n <li class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\n     font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Scrub Typhus is a world wide\r\n     illness, but particular to South East Asia and the Western pacific. It \u00a0<\/span><\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>accounts for\r\napproximately 20% of fever in some regions, in South East Asia, where it is\r\nendemic. Illness lasts for a period of 10 to 12 days after the initial bite.\r\nWith therapy, the fever will break within 36 hours, but if left untreated,\r\ncomplications or death may occur.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657728;left:-125px;\r\ntop:251px;width:1122px;height:253px'><img width=898 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhYgQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAABiBAIAgAAAAAAAAAJJBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsCh8IikWhMHpXMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9yttwv+isGAAgA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width=73