ign=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=246 valign=top style='width:184.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=126 valign=top style='width:94.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=276 valign=top style='width:207.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=246 valign=top style='width:184.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Scrub\r\n  Typhus IgM<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>(ELISA)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=126 valign=top style='width:94.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>0.62<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>OD<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=276 valign=top style='width:207.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&lt;0.50\r\n  (Negative)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\r\n  &gt;0.50 (Positive)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><b><u><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>INTERPRETATION :<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Scrub typhus or tsutsugamushi fever is a\r\nzoonosis, an animal infection that is accidentally transmitted to humans. The\r\ninfection is found only in asia and the westem pacific islands.The causative\r\norganism. orientia tsutsugamushi, is transmitted to humans by the bite of a\r\nlarval mite or chigger.a cigarette burn-like sore,called an eschar.sometimes\r\ndevelops at the site of infection. Swollen lymph glands are common.the bite\r\nfrom an infected chigger may be followed by a systemic illness ranging severity\r\nform inaparent to fatal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>This test only detects the presence of\r\nlgM .tsutsugamushi antibodies in the specimen for the diagnosis of scrub\r\ntyphus.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>As with all diagnostics tests,results must\r\nbe considered with other cinical information available to the physician.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>If the test results are negative and\r\nclinical symptoms persist, aditional follow-up testing using other clinical\r\nmethods is recommended a negative result does not preclude the possibility of\r\ninfection with o tsutsugamushi.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251658752;left:-125px;\r\ntop:453px;width:1122px;height:455px'><img width=898 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhYgQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAQBiBAEAgAAAAAAAAAIgRI6py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC8fy3BYAOw==\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>SCRUB\r\nTYPHUS (TSUTSUGAMUSHI) ANTIBODY IgM, Rapid<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width=738\r\n style='width:553.5pt;margin-left:-8.1pt;border-collapse:collapse'>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=270 valign=top style='width:202.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Test Name<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=144 valign=top style='width:108.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Results<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Unit<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=222 valign=top style='width:166.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Bio.\r\n  Ref. Interval<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=270 valign=top style='width:202.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=144 valign=top style='width:108.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=222 valign=top style='width:166.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.75pt'>\r\n  <td width=270 valign=top style='width:202.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>SCRUB TYPHUS, IgM<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=144 valign=top style='width:108.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NEGATIVE<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.75pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=222 valign=top style='width:166.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\r\n  NEGATIVE<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.75pt'>\r\n  <td width=270 valign=top style='width:202.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Methodology\r\n  : ICT<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=144 valign=top style='width:108.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.75pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.75pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=222 valign=top style='width:166.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.75pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:-13.5pt'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>CLINICAL NOTES <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:-67.65pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:-13.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>It is a rapid, qualitative and\r\ndifferential test for the detection of antibodies IgM to Orientia Tsutsugamushi\r\nin human serum, plasma, whole blood.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:-67.65pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:-13.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:-67.65pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:-13.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:-67.65pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:-13.5pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span lang=EN-US>Scrub Typhus \/\r\nTsutsugamushi fever is a zoonotic disorder transmitted to humans by the bite of\r\na larval mite Orientia tsutsugamushi. The illness varies from mild self\r\nlimiting to fatal ,characterized by fever, headache, myalgia, cough and\r\ngastrointestinal symptoms. Severe cases may develop Encephalitis and\r\nInterstitial pneumonia.Scrub typhus is a febrile illness caused by the obligate\r\nintracellular bacterium ,Orientia tsutsugamushi. It is transmitted by the bite\r\nof infected larvae of a number of trombiculid mite species known to be\r\nprevalent in Asia, the Pacific Rim islands, pockets in the north of Australia,\r\nand some areas of Chile. With few distinguishing clinical characteristics,\r\nscrub typhus is difficult to differentiate from other tropical febrile\r\nillnesses, such as dengue, typhoid fever, leptospirosis, and murine typhus .\r\nThe presence of the pathognomonic eschar, the painless black crust at the site\r\nof mite inoculation, can help in establishing clinical diagnosis due to its\r\nhigh specificity (98.9%), however, its presence in patients varies widely\r\n(7.0%-97.0%)Failure in diagnosing scrub typhus may result in prolonged illness,\r\ncomplications including pneumonitis, acute respiratory distress syndrome, renal\r\nfailure, meningoencephalitis, and unnecessary treatment with inappropriate\r\nantibiotics<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"148.85pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 49.65pt"}}